  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can increase the effect of a power by +75%.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Empower Power, 5th mythic tier.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you manifest a power affected by Empower Power, all variable, numeric effects of the Power are increased by +75%, including bonuses to those dice rolls.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, you may expend a use of mythic power to manifest a power as an empowered power (gaining only the normal benefits of an empowered power, rather than the increased benefits outlined above) without increasing the number of power points spent or expending psionic focus.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> All variable, numeric effects of an empowered power are increased by half including bonuses to those dice rolls.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
